    "bounding box" : [ 72.0, 652.283, 495.992, 673.025 ],
    "font" : "CMR12",
    "font size" : 11.955,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "A symmetric n × n matrix S = [sij] of rank r is said to be a Mandelstam matrix if"
  }, {
    "type" : "list",
    "pdfua_tag" : "L",
    "id" : 11,
