      "font" : "CMBX12",
      "font size" : 11.955,
      "text color" : "[0.0]",
      "content" : "Lemma 2.2. A symmetric n×n matrix S is Mandelstam, i.e. S lies in the region Mn,≤1+d, if and only if it is the Gram matrix of n momentum vectors in (1+d)-dimensional spacetime.",
      "kids" : [ ]
    } ]
